<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00880">
	<title>Replacing headlamp (high/low), day time running light, position lamp, front turn signal lamp, front fog lamp (LED type)</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>replacing front lights (LED type)</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>If headlamp (high/low), day time running light, position lamp, front turn signal lamp, front fog lamp is not functioning, have your vehicle inspected by a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e05181">
			<desc>
				<p>: if equipped</p>
			</desc>
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e05182">
								<title>Type A</title>
								<image href="images/N_SP327_B12_009.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e05183">
								<title>Type B</title>
								<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP327_B12_010.jpg"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ol outputclass="callout" id="e05184">
			<li>
				<p>High beam / Low beam (LED)</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Daytime running light / Position lamp (LED)</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Daytime running light (LED)</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Front fog lamp (LED) <sup>*</sup></p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Daytime running light / Position lamp / Turn signal lamp (LED)</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<note type="note" id="e05185">
			<p>After replacing the headlamp assembly, the headlamp aiming should be adjusted. Have your vehicle inspected by a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
